\description{
Era-correct team identity for a WNBA franchise in a specific season,
plus the available \verb{$ref} URLs for deeper resources (record, statistics,
leaders, coaches, transactions, etc.). Backed by the core-v2 endpoint
\code{sports.core.api.espn.com/v2/sports/basketball/leagues/wnba/seasons/{season}/teams/{team_id}}.

